# Architecture invariants (`INV-*`)

Cross-cutting behavioral rules intended to become CI-analyzers, architecture tests, and startup validators are catalogued in **`docs/library/ARCHITECTURE_INVARIANTS.md`** (stable IDs **`INV-001`** … **`INV-015`**).

Governance draft: **`docs/architecture/adr/0035-architecture-invariant-catalog.md`** (flip **Proposed → Accepted** when reviewed).

Implementation backlog: **`docs/library/TECH_BACKLOG.md`** — **`TB-009`** (documentation / ADR acceptance), **`TB-010`**–**`TB-012`** (enforcement waves).

ADR authoring skeleton (not itself an ADR): **`docs/architecture/adr/adr-template-full.md`** (strict rules: **`docs/architecture/adr/template.md`**).

**Invariant audit vs TB-001:** **`INV-003`** does **not** require synchronous failure on informational async audit paths shipped under **`TB-001`** unless a superseding backlog item merges.
